WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is what people
are talking about, you guys.

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.702 align:start size:94% position:6%
Some big news about
the Russia investigation.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:05.105
It came out that Robert Mueller
wants to interview

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
President Trump.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's gonna be awkward
when Trump tries to flee

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:11.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Mexico and can't climb
over his own wall.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:15.715 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Trump ] I knew I should
have added doggy doors.

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:17.317 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Normal voice ] What?

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:17.951 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You guys see this?

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:19.919 align:start size:94% position:6%
After reports that the
FBI lost some text messages

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:24.624
between two FBI agents involved
with this, Trump tweeted...

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:37.837 align:start size:94% position:6%
The president blames
Samsung for the lost texts.

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:39.906 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was not the first time
he's gone on Twitter

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:41.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
to blame a company
for something.

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:43.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
For example,
Trump once tweeted...

00:00:47.947 --> 00:00:48.448 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow!

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:50.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He's blaming --
-He's blaming Velveeta.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.051 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Blaming Velveeta.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:55.321 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The Kraft Corporation.
-He also tweeted...

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Wow!

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.396 line:92%
-And, finally, he tweeted...

00:01:06.366 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
He won't own up to anything.
-Yeah.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:12.105 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-He's blaming Isotoners.

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:14.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, tonight, Trump
is flying to Switzerland

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.142 line:92%
for The World Economic Forum,

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the flight's supposed
to last eight hours,

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:21.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
or, as they told Trump,
16 "SpongeBobs."

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:23.950 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ As Trump ] Okay.

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:24.818 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay.

00:01:24.818 --> 00:01:26.886 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there are a lots
of protests in Switzerland.

00:01:26.886 --> 00:01:31.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
One person was holding a
sign that said "Dump Trump."

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:32.192 line:92%
But the president wasn't mad.

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:36.262 align:start size:94% position:6%
He said, "Ha ha.
You spelled Donald wrong.

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:38.665 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There's two P's."

00:01:38.665 --> 00:01:41.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
I want to say congrats
to Senator Tammy Duckworth,

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
who will become
the first U.S. Senator

00:01:43.503 --> 00:01:44.904 line:92%
to have a baby while in office.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:49.476 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah. Isn't that great?

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:50.443 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:51.144 size:75% position:38% line:92%
She's having a baby,

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:54.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
so at least we've got
one Senator will who deliver.

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:59.419 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Hey-oh! Ho! Hey! Ho!

00:01:59.419 --> 00:02:00.153 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Check this out, guys.

00:02:00.153 --> 00:02:02.956
Pizza Hut says
if either team beats the record

00:02:02.956 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
for the fastest touchdown
in the Super Bowl,

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:09.195
it's giving away free pizza to
people in its loyalty program.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:10.964 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:13.032 size:84% position:42%
The only downside is --
you have to tell people

00:02:13.032 --> 00:02:17.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you're in the
Pizza Hut loyalty program.

00:02:17.237 --> 00:02:19.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess someone else must have
signed me up for that.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:23.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't remember.
-"Can you punch my card?"

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:23.943 line:92%
-This was pretty big today.

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:26.279
Elton John just announced
that he's going to retire

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:28.381 line:92%
after his next world tour.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.650
There's going to be a
very dramatic moment at the end,

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:32.685 size:78% position:39%
where he admits that
the lyrics really are

00:02:32.685 --> 00:02:35.188 line:92%
"hold me closer, Tony Danza."

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:35.722 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I heard that.

00:02:35.722 --> 00:02:37.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's from a source,
a good source.

00:02:37.957 --> 00:02:41.327
Finally, I saw that two guys
in Minnesota were pulled over

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:45.698 align:start size:94% position:6%
with almost 500 pounds of
weed in their car.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:46.366 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
500 pounds.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:49.669
You could tell it was a lot,
'cause even their GPS was like,

00:02:49.669 --> 00:02:51.237 line:92%
"Forget about the destination.

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's all about
the journey, man."

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:57.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a great show tonight.
Give it up for The Roots!

